                        "review": "I played through the game twice, and once before in 2011 when it was released on Aldorlea's website.  It is one of the most enjoyable rpgs I have ever played.  You control animals in your party.  They are cute and lovable.  There are many hours of gameplay to enjoy.  The quests are fun to complete.  The only annoying things for me were killing the flies and the Lost Haven hiding from ghost pirates island.",
